concept:privacy-amendment-office-of-the-privacy-commissioner-act-2000-sec-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 Commencement"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Subject to subsection (2), this Act commences on a day to be fixed by Proclamation.  (2) If this Act does not commence under subsection (1) within the period of 6 months beginning on the day on which this Act receives the Royal Assent, it commences on the first day after the end of that period." ;
